<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-REPUBLIC H1 NET AT 142 MLN PESOS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-REPUBLIC H1 NET AT 142 MLN PESOS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			   142.65 vs   160.11</p>
<p>    Revenues			   1,076.44 vs 1,075.49</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)	 0.19 vs 0.22</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Republic Glass Holdings Corp. The company said for the second quarter its net income amounted to 102.27 million pesos against 78.52 million a year ago.</p>
